  "description": "This two bed property,  A2 rated, is spacious, light filled, energy efficient and comes furnished. This is a new build and being rented out for the first time.\nThere is a creche, primary school (GCNS) and Secondary School (GCC) within walking distance from the property. There is bus stop right at the entrance of the estate.\n\nAccommodation: 2 bed mid-terraced house with Kitchen/Living Room, Utility/Laundry Room, 2 bedrooms (1 En suite), 3 bathrooms. \n\n**Management fees, bins, cycle shed included in the rent**\n\nAll homes in Hawkins Wood are thoughtfully laid out to make the most of modern family life, while plenty of extra touches such as high-quality kitchens and extra storage space come as standard. A host of energy-efficiency features make these A2 homes as comfortable as they are attractive.\n\nCommuters can choose between many public transport links including the DART (45 mins to Grand Canal) located 5 mins from the development and regular bus service routes, while the new connecting roads to the M11/M50 are all within a short distance from Hawkins Wood.\n\nWithin easy reach you'll find:\nExcellent primary and secondary schools\nLandscaped green spaces and children's playgrounds\nDublin Bus services approximately 200m away, with frequent connections to Greystones and Bray DART stations\nRunning track, sports facilities, skatepark and 5-a-side pitches\nSwimming pool, gym, rugby, GAA and tennis clubs\nGolf course nearby\nDedicated cycle paths into Greystones Town Centre\nGreystones DART Station and the seafront approximately 3km away\nEasy access to the N11 via Farrankelly Road\nIncluded in the Rent\n Management fees\n Bin collection\n Parking \n Secure bicycle storage",
